  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"y equals minus one fifth x\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>x</mi></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"y equals one seventh x\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>x</mi></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The solution to the given system of equations is <math alttext=\"left parenthesis x comma y right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>. What is the value of <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math>?</p>",
